  "Yes. Bluetooth and phone-sensor features work completely offline. Only MQTT and HTTP require an internet connection.": "Sim. Os recursos de Bluetooth e sensores do telefone funcionam completamente offline. Apenas MQTT e HTTP exigem conexão com a internet.",
